'' from -- is gone (2026-10-10). Without the import the 'FB' the parser gave them resolves to
'' nothing, and that is reported once, as TKO0423, not as an undeclared 'fb' or a type
'' '__tko_mod_std_tasks.selectctx'. A program's own stand-in FB.Spawn still works
'' (tests/mir/spawn.test).
